    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Ideal family home in a peaceful rural setting nestled in the scenic countryside of Duhallow. This charming family home offers spacious accommodation, mature landscaped gardens and excellent outdoor facilities. Set on a beautifully maintained site, the property combines rural tranquillity with practical family living and presents an excellent opportunity for those seeking a country residence with additional development potential."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Accommodation\r\nGround  floor consisting of entrance hall, livingroom and kitchen/diningroom. First floor comprises of three bedrooms and shower room."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance hall -  7' 6\"  x  4' 9\" \r\nA welcoming entrance hall providing access to the main living areas.\r\n\r\nLivingroom                                                                                                  13’5’ x1 5’11’’ Wood flooring/fireplace -  21' 4\"  x  15' 3\" \r\nA bright and spacious living room, ideal for family gatherings and entertaining.\r\n\r\nKitchen/diningroom -  20' 3\"  x  18' 7\" \r\nA generous open-plan kitchen and dining area featuring a Stanley Deluxe 90 oil-fired cooker, providing both cooking and heating functionality. This room serves as the heart of the home with ample space for dining and everyday family living.\r\n\r\nStairs & landing - \r\nTimber staircase and landing, adding warmth and character to the property.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 -  12' 9\"  x  11' 9\" \r\nSpacious double bedroom with timber flooring.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 -  12' 6\"  x  10' 6\" \r\nDouble bedroom with timber flooring and built-in storage.\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 -  11' 6\"  x  8' 3\" \r\nComfortable bedroom with excellent natural light.\r\n\r\nShower room - 8.58m x 6.50m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "•\tOil-fired central heating\r\n•\tTriple glazed windows throughout.\r\n•\tFeature stone walls throughout the house\r\n•\tWell water/septic tank.\r\n•\tLarge workshop\r\n•\tOuthouse suitable for conversion (subject to planning permission)\r\n•\tBeautifully manicured mature gardens to the front and rear\r\n•\tConcrete driveway\r\n•\tOutside tap\r\n•\tAttractive entrance piers\r\n•\tNewmarket 10 minutes/Killarney 45 minutes/Kiskeam 5 minutes/Mallow 35 minutes/Boherbue 8 minutes/Kanturk 20 minutes.\r\n•\tPeaceful rural location"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: G"
      }
